<%- include('partials/header-professional', { title: locals.title || 'Saraswati UGC NET', script: locals.script || '' }) %>
<main class="landing-page">
  <section class="learn-hero">
    <div class="container learn-hero-grid">
      <div class="learn-hero-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> YOUR UGC NET PREPARATION, SIMPLIFIED</span>
        <h1>A little progress today.<br><em>A bigger future tomorrow.</em></h1>
        <p>Build your understanding. Practise with purpose. Prepare for UGC NET Paper 1 and Political Science with guidance from Saraswati.</p>
        <div class="learn-hero-actions">
          <a href="/courses" class="btn btn-primary">Explore courses <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a href="/available-tests" class="btn btn-outline">Try a mock test <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-assurances"><span>✓ English &amp; Hindi</span><span>✓ Exam-style practice</span><span>✓ Learn at your pace</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="mentor-feature">
        <div class="mentor-feature-top"><span>LEARN WITH CLARITY</span><span class="mentor-star" aria-hidden="true">✦</span></div>
        <img src="/images/dr-rajesh-mishra-portrait.jpg" alt="Dr. Rajesh Mishra, Saraswati UGC NET mentor" fetchpriority="high">
        <div class="mentor-feature-caption"><div><small>YOUR MENTOR</small><h2>Dr. Rajesh Mishra</h2><p>Political Science · UGC NET</p></div><a href="/about" aria-label="Meet your mentor">↗</a></div>
        <div class="mentor-note"><span aria-hidden="true">◎</span><div><strong>Understand. Practise. Improve.</strong><small>A focused path to your next goal.</small></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="study-strip"><div class="container"><span>One place for your preparation</span><strong>Paper 1</strong><span class="strip-dot">·</span><strong>Political Science</strong><span class="strip-dot">·</span><strong>Mock tests</strong><span class="strip-dot">·</span><strong>Study resources</strong></div></div>
  <section class="learn-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="learn-section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">CHOOSE YOUR FORMAT</span><h2>Learn it. Then test it.</h2><p>Start with video lectures to build understanding, or go straight to timed test practice.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/courses">Browse all courses &amp; tests <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
      <div class="format-paths"><a href="/courses?format=video" class="format-path format-path-lectures"><span class="format-path-icon">▶</span><span><strong>Video Lectures</strong><small>Structured lessons for Paper 1 and Political Science.</small></span><span>→</span></a><a href="/courses?format=tests" class="format-path format-path-tests"><span class="format-path-icon">✓</span><span><strong>Test Series</strong><small>Timed mock tests with results and review.</small></span><span>→</span></a></div>
      <p class="class-delivery-note">Purchase here. Video-class access is arranged separately by our team through an external application.</p><div class="learning-course-grid">
      <% const homeCourses = locals.featuredCourses || locals.courses || []; %>
      <% if (homeCourses.length) { homeCourses.slice(0,3).forEach((course, index) => { %>
        <article class="learning-course">
          <a class="learning-course-art tone-<%= index %>" href="/course/<%= course._id %>" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><span><%= course.category || 'UGC NET' %></span><strong><%= course.title %></strong><span class="course-art-symbol"><%= ['◒','✳','◎'][index] %></span></a>
          <div class="learning-course-body"><span class="eyebrow"><%= /test|series|mock/i.test((course.category || '') + ' ' + (course.title || '')) ? 'TEST SERIES' : 'VIDEO LECTURES' %> · <%= course.category || 'UGC NET' %></span><h3><a href="/course/<%= course._id %>"><%= course.title %></a></h3><p><%= course.shortDescription || 'Focused preparation with practice and study materials to support your next step.' %></p><div class="learning-course-meta"><span>English &amp; Hindi</span><span><%= course.duration || 'Self-paced' %></span></div><div class="learning-course-bottom"><strong><%= course.price === 0 ? 'Free' : '₹' + Number(course.price || 0).toLocaleString('en-IN') %></strong><a class="text-link" href="/course/<%= course._id %>"><%= /test|series|mock/i.test((course.category || '') + ' ' + (course.title || '')) ? 'View test series' : 'View course' %> →</a></div></div>
        </article>
      <% }); } else { %>
        <div class="learning-empty"><h3>Your next course is on its way.</h3><p>Explore the study library while we prepare the next course.</p><a class="text-link" href="/knowledge-base">Browse free resources →</a></div>
      <% } %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="learn-section learning-method"><div class="container"><div class="learn-section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">A ROUTINE YOU CAN KEEP</span><h2>Less guesswork. More progress.</h2></div><p>Move from learning a concept to knowing where you stand.</p></div><div class="method-grid">
    <a href="/courses" class="method-card"><span class="step-number">01 / LEARN</span><h3>Build a strong foundation.</h3><p>Start with the topics you need, with a clear path through your subject.</p><span class="method-link">Explore courses ↗</span></a>
    <a href="/available-tests" class="method-card"><span class="step-number">02 / PRACTISE</span><h3>Get comfortable with the exam.</h3><p>Use timed mock tests to work on accuracy, confidence and time management.</p><span class="method-link">Find a mock test ↗</span></a>
    <a href="/my-results" class="method-card"><span class="step-number">03 / REFLECT</span><h3>Make your next session count.</h3><p>Review your answers, understand your mistakes and see how you improve.</p><span class="method-link">See your results ↗</span></a>
  </div></div></section>
  <section class="learn-section"><div class="container resource-callout"><div><span class="eyebrow">KEEP YOUR CURIOSITY GOING</span><h2>A little reading goes a long way.</h2><p>Explore topic notes, preparation articles and resources for your next study session.</p><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/knowledge-base">Open the study library →</a></div><div class="resource-stack" aria-hidden="true"><span>PAPER 1 / TEACHING APTITUDE</span><span>POLITICAL SCIENCE / CORE CONCEPTS</span><span>EXAM PREPARATION / STUDY GUIDES</span></div></div></section>
  <section class="learn-section faq-section" id="questions"><div class="container faq-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">BEFORE YOU BEGIN</span><h2>A few helpful answers.</h2><p>Need help choosing a course?</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact">Talk to us →</a></div><div class="faq-list">
    <details><summary>Where should I start?</summary><p>Browse the available courses to find your paper or subject. You can also explore study materials before choosing a course.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Can I practise on my phone?</summary><p>Yes. Courses, resources and mock tests are designed to work on smaller screens. Sign in to save your test progress and view your results.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Are there free courses or tests?</summary><p>Use the Free filter on the courses or mock-tests page to see the free options currently available.</p></details>
    <details><summary>How do I review my performance?</summary><p>After submitting a test, open My Results to see your score and review your answers. Your dashboard brings your courses and recent tests together.</p></details>
  </div></div></section>
  <section class="learn-section"><div class="container ready-card"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT CHAPTER</span><h2>Start where you are.<br>Build from here.</h2><p>Your preparation deserves a clear direction.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/signup">Create your free account →</a></div></section>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footer-professional') %>

